{
  "title": "下跌不用担心，强支撑区域回调都是进场机会",
  "author": "顶底之王",
  "publish_time": "",
  "url": "http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUxODM4ODM5Mg==&mid=2247487046&idx=1&sn=bd52df06682d2b281c0c823d44326b57&chksm=f848115b1258a35ed711189dcbfb2b41cb871ac785e84509a2f054a07da350884df8ee17063a&scene=27#wechat_redirect",
  "content_text": "A股强支撑区域，回调都是进场机会。\n今天美韩科技股崩盘，A股也一起跌。但之前视频已经详细分析，现在A股多个底部迹象已经同时出现。\n可能不会马上拉升，有一个震荡筑底的过程，但短期想再大跌概率很低。\n交易先定大方向。\n下跌趋势，或强阻力区域的上涨，只要没破位，不管多大阳线，都是出场时机。\n上涨趋势，或强支撑区域的下跌，不管多大阴线，也都是进场时机。\n如果还像今天这种有外部因素的影响，更不用担心。更不用说韩国股市也跌到了支撑区域。\n虽然短期没问题，但中长线科技最好只看反弹。\n美股费城半导体板块上涨趋势已经结束，刚走出M头顶部形态，韩股早领先一步破位。\nA股像芯片半导体，电子，通信等科技板块前一波下跌也都跌穿了低点。\n中长线看，只有低估值传统板块，有机会见底走趋势性行情。也大概率是下一波引领指数上涨的主线。\n刘广义\nA0260626040026\n投资有风险 入市需谨慎\n个人观点 仅供参考\n案例截图不做投资依据\n上海中广云证券咨询有限公司",
  "content_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \"><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">A股强支撑区域，回调都是进场机会。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">今天美韩科技股崩盘，A股也一起跌。但之前视频已经详细分析，现在A股多个底部迹象已经同时出现。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">可能不会马上拉升，有一个震荡筑底的过程，但短期想再大跌概率很低。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">交易先定大方向。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">下跌趋势，或强阻力区域的上涨，只要没破位，不管多大阳线，都是出场时机。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">上涨趋势，或强支撑区域的下跌，不管多大阴线，也都是进场时机。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">如果还像今天这种有外部因素的影响，更不用担心。更不用说韩国股市也跌到了支撑区域。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003393\" data-ratio=\"0.2740740740740741\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Bgib4dvhgGgzayN9n6JaCgzy09S73CCWxLoPwiclaw1jVjiaicSRMJMtcN2uCb6x7w3Vj6jIS5lQKRHxl0EgmCBZiblq8lHCPl23iciauTzDsL3Jibk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\"/></section><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">虽然短期没问题，但中长线科技最好只看反弹。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">美股费城半导体板块上涨趋势已经结束，刚走出M头顶部形态，韩股早领先一步破位。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">A股像芯片半导体，电子，通信等科技板块前一波下跌也都跌穿了低点。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003394\" data-ratio=\"0.3932702418506835\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Bgib4dvhgGgyg5gdCj0SFia8GuiaGABfy6nUMQovM1MCu9ghKpicDlqcib9AMp8e2A0e4lxibLAYtZeA0OjY3XfZJibnuE90gVAicJSuOdA4MqSKSgQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"951\" type=\"block\"/></section><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">中长线看，只有低估值传统板块，有机会见底走趋势性行情。也大概率是下一波引领指数上涨的主线。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003395\" data-ratio=\"0.30185185185185187\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Bgib4dvhgGgwia4LcTAG2zJyUE49pWccBLA3Hda1j4TOpicTHD3UCg45kb8ExjxEOsFezNxcGuiaWGo3DwxZDdnmOM1wcUpjiaLP5p3txgwHRdIc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\"/></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style='-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\"